2026-07-27T11:10:49.1294047Z i /tmp/Rtmp3CeE9G/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:10:49.1294356Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:10:49.1294705Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:10:49.1295010Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:10:49.1295817Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:10:49.1296550Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:10:49.1297417Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
